vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型全量开源，支持百万上下文并采用MoE架构</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI更新ChatGPT移动端界面并扩展Dots功能至更多订阅用户</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">90位诺奖及图灵奖得主联名质疑Anthropic安全人设</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式向开发者开放 Genie 4 世界模型 API，每分钟调用成本约 6 美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月19日正式向开发者开放世界模型 Genie 4，支持通过 Gemini API 及 AI Studio 调用。该模型可根据文本、图像或图文组合，实时生成720p、24fps的连续可交互世界，并同步生成环境音与对白，输出内容均嵌入SynthID水印。Genie 4支持通过文本指令动态修改天气、光照及剧情，交互响应延迟在0.2至0.5秒之间，主要面向交互原型设计、空间可视化及机器人与智能体训练场景。计费模式方面，Genie 4不设免费层，折算后视频输出成本约为6.05美元/分钟。官方提示，单次会话上限为120秒，且最佳连贯性维持在45至90秒内，用户需显式调用complete()或cancel()接口以停止计费。目前该服务仅由美国数据中心提供，且暂不支持持久化3D资产存储。同期，谷歌还发布了推理模型Ge</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正研发通用型全功能AI代理，计划于2027年底正式发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/119548af0d0ca736099893bcd138f7ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正加速研发一款通用型全功能AI Agent，旨在与OpenAI、Anthropic及Meta等竞品直接竞争，计划于2027年底发布。该项目由软件工程主管Craig Federighi主导，定位远超现有Siri及Apple Intelligence Suite，具备跨应用操作、网页浏览、代码编写、API调用及多步骤任务规划能力。为确保安全，苹果将构建强权限模型与沙箱机制，延续端侧隐私保护策略。面对Meta Muse及谷歌Gemini等竞品在Mac端控制能力的渗透，苹果正通过macOS 27.3测试版收紧生态控制，大幅增加第三方AI工具的权限获取步骤。此举标志着系统级AI入口争夺战升级，苹果试图通过生态壁垒与自研AI Agent双管齐下，重构端侧AI竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型全量开源，支持百万上下文并采用MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/251646a3fd79fbdf3d24a2b3fcafa612.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，腾讯混元团队正式开源Hy4大模型，模型权重已同步上线GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode。此次开源标志着混元LLM系列实现全量开放，涵盖Hy3、Hy4及Hy4flash等多个版本。旗舰版Hy4采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量770B，激活参数49B，支持100万Token上下文窗口。同步开源的Hy4flash主打高性价比，总参数量224B，激活参数12B，支持多模态输入及100万Token上下文。两款模型均采用Apache 2.0协议，允许商业使用与修改。腾讯混元还发布了Hy4安全评估卡片，明确训练数据剔除了漏洞利用等攻击性内容，并经腾讯玄武与科恩实验室审计，确保无进攻性能力风险。此次开源为开发者提供了更灵活的部署选择，助力企业级应用落地与二次开发。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI更新ChatGPT移动端界面并扩展Dots功能至更多订阅用户</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6600e16afd415b6a99a37c7fc1cc7b03.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于2026年11月20日启动ChatGPT移动端界面改版，将Dots功能扩展至ChatGPT Business Standard及部分Plus用户。新版界面将Dots置于主屏幕底部标签页，并允许用户将Codex、Projects和Images等模块固定至底部导航，旨在缩短高频功能访问路径。该测试目前面向年满18岁的Pro用户及部分符合条件的Plus用户，但不覆盖欧洲经济区、英国、瑞士和韩国。此外，OpenAI深化了ChatGPT Health的跨平台能力，现已支持连接Android Health Connect，可提供睡眠与活动深度分析。Dot功能可读取健康记录，实现日程冲突调整及预防性护理提醒。此次更新标志着ChatGPT正从单一对话窗口向多工具中枢与主动助理演进，通过功能分层与主动交互优化，进一</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">90位诺奖及图灵奖得主联名质疑Anthropic安全人设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">北京时间11月20日，Anthropic正式登陆纳斯达克，IPO募资813亿美元，市值达1.271万亿美元，创下史上最大规模股票发行纪录。然而在上市前夕，近90位诺贝尔奖、图灵奖及菲尔兹奖得主联合发布《MisAnthropic Statement》声明，公开质疑其“安全人设”。联署者指出Anthropic存在三重矛盾：一是其在警示递归自我改进AI风险的同时，仍将相关技术作为核心竞争力推进；二是利用安全形象吸引资本与人才，却被指正在降低安全标准并游说监管规则；三是质疑其借公共安全之名垄断AI技术权力。尽管面临学术界与安全研究者的集体质疑，Anthropic首日股价仍收涨17.07%。此次事件凸显了AI行业在追求商业化扩张与维持安全承诺之间的深层裂缝，将“安全”与“生意”的博弈直接带入公开市场。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
